                                                <ul>
                                                    <li>
                                                        <strong><span style="color:red">New Fixed Interview Pricing Policy- </span></strong> <a id="documentid" target="_blank" title="New Interview Policy" href="https://risebirdportal.blob.core.windows.net/template/NewInterviewPricingPolicy.pdf">Click here</a>
                                                        <br />
                                                        <strong>Note:</strong> Flat pricing will be applicable on new JDs, ongoing JDs and interviews will have ongoing pricing" and " For transparency,  base pay and variable pay will be visible in the open interviews section and you are advised to assign the interview after careful consideration.
                                                    </li>
                                                    <li>
                                                        <strong><span style="color:red">Net time of interview- </span></strong>All IAAS platform manually start the recording after the candidate arrival and settlement but Risebird starts the recording  by default automatically, which results in counting unproductive minutes . Our customers have stopped paying for unproductive minutes time in the start and are counting net time which is 5 minutes less than total recorded time. Given the ongoing recession in tech hiring we don't have much say in customer decisions and request your cooperation. From May onwards , net interview time will be applicable for your payments.
                                                    </li>
                                                    <li>
                                                        <strong> No Payment for No Show Candidates- </strong> Customers have never paid Risebird for candidate no-shows while other IAAS platforms also don't pay for candidate noshows, and Risebird is the only platform which paid for candidate no-shows from its inception and has been constantly incurring the losses from last 4 years by paying for candidate noshows. But in the current poor macro environment, it's not possible to continue to pay any amount for candidate no show..
                                                    </li>
                                                    <li>
                                                        <strong>For Late Feedback Report- </strong> Customers demand the feedback report of candidates immediately after the completion of interviews. While other IAAS platforms have been penalizing interviewers for submitting reports after 3 hrs, Risebird has been avoiding any penalties but now our customers are demanding the reporting time to be at par or before the other IAAS platform. In order to achieve the same, we have to penalize for any submission made after 3 hrs (50% deduction on payment) after 24 hrs (100% deduction on payment terms ).
                                                    </li>
                                                    <li>All the interviews will be assessed for <strong>Quality by our QC Team</strong>. Kindly ensure you adhere to standard practices to avoid attracting penalty. <a target="_blank" href="https://risebirdportal.blob.core.windows.net/regulatorycompliancedocuments/Risebird_QC_Guidelines.docx">Click Here</a> to know all standard points.</li>
                                                    <li>
