<div id="InterviewerPaymentDetailsModel" class="modal modal-bg" style="z-index:5">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg" role="document">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="filheader">
                <div class="filavatar">
                    <span>
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path fill="rgb(255, 255, 255)" d="M17 3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H2c-.55 0-1 .45-1 1v11c0 .55.45 1 1 1h11.5l3.5 3V3z"></path></svg>
                    </span>
                </div>
                <h5 class="modal-title pull-left">Notification <span class="popup-text" id="skill_id_pop"></span></h5>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
                <span onclick="closeInterviewerPaymentDetailsModel()" aria-hidden="true" style="cursor:pointer;">&times;</span>
            </button>

            <input type="text" hidden id="txtinterviewid" />
            <div class="modal-body" style="color:black">
                Dear Interviewer,<br />

                Congratulations!!, finally we are launching plans and flat payment model for IT services companies. Plans allow us to cater to different needs of customers and to offer competitive pricing which eventually brings more interviews demand for all our interviewers. Depending on the plan chosen by customer, you will get below mentioned flat payment irrespective of select or reject candidate.
                <br />
                For transparency, we will be showing base pay and variable pay in open interviews section and you are advised to assign the interview after careful consideration.
                <br />
                <strong>Note:</strong> Flat pricing will be applicable on new JDs, ongoing JDs and interviews will have ongoing pricing" and " For transparency,  base pay and variable pay will be visible in the open interviews section and you are advised to assign the interview after careful consideration.
                <br />
                <strong>Base Pay</strong><br />
                <div>
                    1.Standard (S)- Minimum Interview duration = minimum 40 mins for select/reject<br />
                    <ul>
                        <li>INR 350 per completed interview for offshore</li>
                        <li>INR 500 per completed interview for onsite</li>
                    </ul>
                    2.Pro (P)- Minimum Interview duration = minimum 50 mins for select/reject<br />
                    <ul>
                        <li>INR 420 per completed interview for offshore</li>
                        <li>INR 840 per completed interview for onsite</li>
                    </ul>
                    3.Advanced (A)- Minimum Interview duration = minimum 60 mins for select/reject<br />
                    <ul>
                        <li>INR 500 per completed interview for offshore</li>
                        <li>INR 1000 per completed interview for onsite</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <strong>Variable Pay - up to INR 120 per interview</strong><br />
                <div>
                    <ul>
                        <li>QC rating => 100% error free or zero red flags = INR 50 per completed interview</li>
                        <li>Client rating => 5 = INR 50 per completed interview</li>
                        <li> Candidate rating=> 5 = INR 20 per completed interview</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <strong style="color:red">Penalties</strong><br />
                <div>
                    1. For completing interviews of lesser duration than mentioned above. 5 minutes grace is allowed. For example, if in standard interview your net duration is 30 mins, 5 min grace period will not result in any deduction but additional 5 mins will result in penalty (INR 50) will be deducted on pro rata basis<br />
                    2. Late reports - for delay, which is more than 3 hours, 12 hrs, 24hrs<br />
                    3. Unassignment of interviews- INR 250 for unassigning interviews<br />
                    4. QC reports - red flag = INR 50 per red flag<br />
                    5. Poor client rating (less than 4) = 50% of interview amount after RB QC review<br />
                    6. Poor candidate rating (less than 4) = = 50% of interview amount after RB QC review<br />
                    7. Redo request from client = = 100% of interview amount after RB QC review<br />
                </div>
                <strong>Surcharge - will be provided to handle exceptions. Our team will update if any surcharge is provided to you.</strong><br />
                <div>For Product companies and Startups different pricing will be applicable which will be informed to you separately.</div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="InterviewerVideoConfirmModel" class="modal modal-bg" style="z-index:6">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg" role="document">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="filheader">
                <div class="filavatar">
                    <span>
                        <img style="width: 32px;
    position: relative;
    top: 7px;" src="~/img/video-confirm.png" />
                    </span>
                </div>
                <h5 class="modal-title pull-left">Interview Video Confirmation <span class="popup-text" id="skill_id_pop"></span></h5>
            </div>
            @*<button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
            <span onclick="closeInterviewerVideoConfirmModel()" aria-hidden="true" style="cursor:pointer;">&times;</span>
            </button>*@
            <div class="modal-body" style="color:black">
                <h3>
                    <strong>
                        Open your video, <span style="color:green">earn 10-20% more</span> on every interview - <span style="color: green;
    font-size: 16px;">Yes</span>, <span style="color: red;font-size: 16px;">No</span>
                    </strong>
                </h3>
                <div class="instruction">
                    <ul>
                        <li>Risebird is rewarding interviewers who are opening their video throughout the length of the interviews. Interviewers with video-on track record, will be part of preferred interviewer list and future interviews allotment will be prioritised for such interviewers</li>
                        <li>Yes, we know that opening the video may concern you about your identity disclosure</li>
                        <li>But think more, just a video stream can reveal your identity ? Can someone just memorize your video and find on the internet what your name is, which company you work for  :) ? NO</li>
                        <li>Risebird never shares, resume, email, phone, company name or any other personal information with its customers</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="del-inst">
                    <h4 style="color:brown"><strong>All interview video recordings get deleted automatically from all records within 15 days</strong></h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Video is shared through secure URLs , only authorized people can access it. They can not download it, they can not screen record it. Most of the customer just browse the video for few minutes to check the authenticity, they hardly have time to check the whole recording</li>
                        <li>If you say <span style="color:green; font-weight:bold">YES</span>, Risebird will team will verify your interview recording and if video is found on than <span style="color:green; font-weight:bold">10%-20% extra</span> will be paid in your payment cycle . In couple of weeks it will be shown in Payment Tab. This payment is conditional to the fact that your interview feedback report is not having significant penalty</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="model-footer text-center">
                <input type="button" onclick="InterviewerVideoConfirmationStatus(1)" value="Yes! Interested" class="yes-btn" />
                <input type="button" onclick="InterviewerVideoConfirmationStatus(2)" value="No! Not Interested" class="no-btn" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div id="PaymentSLADetailsModel" class="modal modal-bg" style="z-index:6">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg" role="document">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="filheader">
                <div class="filavatar">
                    <span>
                        <img style="width: 32px;position: relative;top: 7px;" src="~/img/video-confirm.png" />
                    </span>
                </div>
                <h5 class="modal-title pull-left">Payment SLA </h5>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body" style="color:black">
                <h3>
                    <strong>
                        Dear Interviewer,
                    </strong>
                </h3>
                <p>
                    while many of you are delivering professional interview feedback reports, some 20--30% of our reports are delivered by unprofessional interviewers in non acceptable format to customers. This results in customers holding payments and also dropping out from the platform- which eventually damages the good work of the remaining 80% of professional interviewers and also the brand of Risebird. Just think , will you accept unfinished products - if not, how do you accept customers to accept bad feedback reports?
                </p>
                <p>If you deliver quality reports, we will pay an additional reward of 10-20% per interview. </p>
                <p>But if report quality is poor, our quality control team and customers can cut your payment (5%-100%) on below quality parameters and severe non compliance  can result in temporary or permanent inactivation of your profile from Risebird platform. All deduction requests will be carefully vetted by us before it impacts your payment or inactivation. Please read it carefully and provide your acceptance before taking further interviews on Risebird platform.</p>
                <div class="instruction">
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Attention is not on candidates and on interview dynamics-</strong> Doing other concurrent tasks, not listening alertly, responding after delay</li>
                        <li><strong>Plagiarism - </strong>Using questions from the internet or from A.I. (chatgpt) as it is, we do plagiarism check and expect 80% original questions from your work experience or intelligent modification of questions</li>
                        <li><strong>Inaccurate/ Arbitrary decision making -</strong> False positive (average, below average selection), False negative (rejection of good candidate) , Lacking Sincerity</li>
                        <li><strong>Time Management -</strong> Late start , end before time, too fast/too slow, wasting time on irrelevant points</li>
                        <li><strong>Questions Relevance -</strong> Irrelevant, mismatch difficulty level, theoretical / abstract / google questions- what is this/that, not adding questions in report</li>
                        <li><strong>Score Rubric Ignorance-</strong> asking questions which are not linked to desired scoring rubric, filling score rubric without cognizance</li>
                        <li><strong>Poor Feedback Comments -</strong> Grammatical errors, Spelling mistakes, Wrong sentence formation, Repetition, of short without any clear explanation for selection or for rejection , too generic, Irrelevant points, commenting on areas which are not evaluated , Providing score instead of comments</li>
                        <li><strong>Candidate Interaction Quality -</strong> Personal Information, Reading questions without interacting, Personal remarks, Outside scope of interview, Bias, Impatience, Disrespect</li>
                        <li><strong>Limited Hands on coding / Practical scenarios-</strong> not checking actual competency of candidate</li>
                        <li><strong>Wrong Status Updates -</strong> Marking no show candidate as Completed, Marking interviewer noshow as Drop-reject, Marking not qualified candidate as selected</li>
                        <li><strong>Poor Infrastructure -</strong> Internet , Video, Audio, constraints , BG Noise, Firewalls blocking, Using Mobile phones</li>
                        <li><strong>Proctoring Ignorance-</strong> Conducting interviews while candidate video is off, Ignoring suspicious candidate , Ignoring use of suspicious apps or cheating by candidate</li>
                        <li><strong>Unethical Practices-</strong>Bribery, Biases, Fake reporting, Fake interviewing, Impersonation,Fake selections, Fake rejections</li>
                        <li><strong>Poor Communication Skills-</strong> Using language other than English, Unable to articulate questions, Confusing candidates, Speaking too fast, too slow</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="model-footer text-center">
                <input type="checkbox" id="chk_interviewernotifcation" onchange="ConfirmAgreePaymentSLADetails()" />I agree to above payment SLA terms.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
